        </p>
        <p>
            You celebrate Coocook as much as we do and want to make it better, too? Great!
            <a href="https://gitlab.com/coocook/coocook/issues">Report bugs or suggestions for improvement</a>
            or even become part of the open volunteer development team.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
